  "sourceTitle": "How Cresta turned CX expertise into an agent builder on the Claude Agent SDK",
  "sourceBodyHash": "8c5c06a6778f3a8284e71cd63ef3be97e8c2bab68b410fd4ce456c8620fdb154",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "partial",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "groq",
  "requestedModel": "openai/gpt-oss-120b",
  "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-06T20:27:09.965952Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-06T21:06:58.607154Z",
  "totalBlocks": 60,
  "translatedBlocks": 59,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fd0bf74118d36bd5",
      "translationZh": "Cresta 如何将 CX 专业知识转化为 Claude Agent SDK 上的代理构建器",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7865a53f4409a8c",
      "translationZh": "在我们的系列《初创公司如何使用Claude构建》中，我们探讨了AI产品背后的决策。本篇文章将介绍Cresta如何将其在构建AI原生客户体验方面的专长转化为Conductor——一个帮助开发者构建和改进其他代理（agent）的代理。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61a45d91df965340",
      "translationZh": "已筹集超过2.7亿美元，年经常性收入超过1亿美元。帮助美国联合航空、CVS健康和万豪等组织提供卓越的客户体验",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a820503de4cf714a",
      "translationZh": "构建用于客户体验场景的企业级 AI 代理，需要理解遍布于各种客户互动中的上下文信息。例如，客户可能会：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "12cee73c7e5cb1dc",
      "translationZh": "要求退款而不说明他们指的是哪笔购买,",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c39838f6e0a96956",
      "translationZh": "在同一条消息中报告计费问题和登录问题，或者",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7dca49393858ee35",
      "translationZh": "在退货窗口关闭后请求退款。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c801a8ce07b3631a",
      "translationZh": "为了正确回应，代理可能需要检查客户购买了什么、退款政策、他们的账户历史记录或付款状态。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42e9bf767b13e12d",
      "translationZh": "Cresta 看到这些互动的规模。其平台提供客户体验、能够自行处理对话的 AI 代理、为与其协作的人工代理提供实时指导，并展示对话智能，以表明业务应在哪里改进。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c3b7aef766a8d250",
      "translationZh": "构建和维护客户体验代理要求组织在运营需求上做出关键决策：代理需要知道什么、必须访问哪些系统，以及其行为应在何处灵活或确定性。Cresta 希望让更多团队能够使用这一判断，而无需每个团队从头开始。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "44f9d94de6465ae0",
      "translationZh": "Conductor 是这一成果：一种自然语言代理构建工具，帮助团队将复杂的业务情境转化为可投入生产的代理。用户描述他们想要构建的内容，Conductor 从经过验证的蓝图出发，指导工作进行实施、评估和优化。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "108cc8cb86672381",
      "translationZh": "Cresta 最初使用 Claude Sonnet 和 Claude Opus 构建了 Conductor 的早期版本，以帮助内部团队支持客户部署。悬而未决的问题是 Cresta 是否能够将该系统转化为客户可直接在平台上使用的产品，以构建代理。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de50481462c49854",
      "translationZh": "为了进行开放式的开发工作，Conductor 使用 Claude Agent SDK 作为通用的 harness，以收集上下文、使用工具、编写和运行代码，并根据结果进行调整。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ddfca6c4a51d44c",
      "translationZh": "“我们在内部将 Claude Code 用作开发工具，因为它在构建代理的软件开发方面非常有效，” Cresta Conductor 工程负责人 Renjie Li 说道。“Claude Agent SDK 让我们能够以编程方式使用同样的代理开发 harness。通过 Conductor，我们将其与 Cresta 深度对话智能、CX 专业知识、评估和运行时相连接，以便用户获得我们希望从第一天就能拥有的代理构建体验。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65d6d2af6366f274",
      "translationZh": "Cresta 报告称，在 Cresta 及其合作伙伴的早期使用案例中，Conductor 使初始部署时间大约减半。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0c381ec889667c26",
      "translationZh": "有助于构建下一个代理的元代理",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b30ddf716a23449",
      "translationZh": "Conductor 是一个基于 CX 代理开发既定最佳实践构建的自我改进的元代理。随着团队使用它构建和优化更多代理，他们会捕获自己的验证模式、工作流和专家判断。这会形成一个知识飞轮，使未来的开发更快且更一致。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd38f2618d134f1a",
      "translationZh": "上线后，生产交互、工作流结果和反馈将成为下一次改进的新信号。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "769e3822c1dc96c9",
      "translationZh": "Conductor 帮助构建者将代理构建过程中所学的内容转化为可重用的内存工件，捕获模式、业务规则和评估方法。然后他们可以将其作为技能与团队其他成员共享，使他人能够基于同样的验证实践进行构建。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "abb9d6703110f2d7",
      "translationZh": "让重要决策变得更容易",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8252f47a38832b84",
      "translationZh": "编写第一个提示只是构建有用代理的一部分。较难的抉择在于对话应保持何种灵活性以及何时需要明确的业务规则和受控的工具行为。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5eb7fee43f8c45ee",
      "translationZh": "\"你不想过于确定性，否则你会创建一个试图映射每个可能分支的巨大决策树……但有一些对企业至关重要的工作流，你需要确保它们始终能够运行，尤其是对于风险容忍度低的高度监管行业，\" said Renjie. \"Conductor 有助于发现和巩固那些确定性需求以及具有灵活性以改善整体体验的实现。\"",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a19226e8e2886772",
      "translationZh": "Conductor 利用历史对话来帮助团队确定人应在何处保持在环中以及模型可以在何处获得适应空间。一旦这些边界被设定，开发者仍然需要根据它们旨在执行的需求来测试确定性部分，并在底层业务规则变化时修订这些测试。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bdb878336e098d2d",
      "translationZh": "Cresta 如何评估 Conductor",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8cbb71d0c29f4c7",
      "translationZh": "Conductor 的衡量标准在于它构建代理的效果。为此，Cresta 让 Conductor 经过一系列构建任务：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fde7c1571cf33e94",
      "translationZh": "编写一个测试用例",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "97a204d5fcc0b8cf",
      "translationZh": "修改一个已存在的代理",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3b23083aa35ee0af",
      "translationZh": "执行根本原因分析",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b4757c5f9465a61",
      "translationZh": "完成任务并不是唯一的标准。团队还会审视结果、Conductor 是如何达成这些结果的，以及在此过程中使用了哪些工具。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e6a30115ca6a59d",
      "translationZh": "评估 问题 它回答 结果",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c32d6eff84ef3ff",
      "translationZh": "Conductor 是否生成了请求的可用制品？",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "663dfe3a8df0b104",
      "translationZh": "它是否使用了适当的工具和所需的上下文？",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "767a124eb1d539f9",
      "translationZh": "结果与精心策划的参考相比如何？",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4465b56034bd3aec",
      "translationZh": "任务需要多少时间和模型使用量？",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55dec3dab6c34fd1",
      "translationZh": "相同的评估纪律已内置于 Conductor 中，用户可以检查并查看其代理是否按预期运行。Conductor 将构建阶段捕获的需求和边缘情况转化为其评估模块中的测试。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b71d401519033901",
      "translationZh": "团队可以在策略、连接的系统和对话模式发生变化时，监控需要始终正常运行的工作流。这为他们提供了一种实用的方法，能够在业务变化时更新代理，而不会失去已经强化的工作流的可靠性。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "91577d10a56d6f04",
      "translationZh": "在 Claude Agent SDK 上构建 Conductor",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c0b7bbb2f867e5b",
      "translationZh": "Cresta 将 Conductor 设计为面向客户体验（CX）的代理开发控制平面。它将对话数据、领域专长和开发实践汇聚在一起，并通过策略、可观测性、验证以及反馈驱动的改进来治理每一次代理运行。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "57048f3cd16b849e",
      "translationZh": "Claude Agent SDK 位于 Conductor 之下，充当通用执行框架。它负责收集上下文、调用工具以及编写和运行代码的工作；Conductor 在此基础上叠加 Cresta 的 CX 工作流、工具和领域上下文。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe41278a693139a6",
      "translationZh": "团队对 SDK 进行了评估，以满足 Conductor 所需的工作：具有多个步骤、丰富上下文以及重复工具使用的任务。评审涵盖了数据隐私、租户架构、组织级密钥分发、控制以及实现过程中的可观测性。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5ed4d05790f34a4",
      "translationZh": "“Anthropic 为我们提供了一个强大且通用的基础平台，用于代理式软件开发。这使我们能够将工程投入放在 Cresta 能创造最持久客户价值的地方，” Cresta 工程副总裁陈祥儒 说。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e93c4e2f5ea19820",
      "translationZh": "将Cresta的工程专长直接交到客户手中",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7c578ed5e05220a",
      "translationZh": "Conductor 在 Cresta 内部启动，帮助其前线部署团队了解哪些开发任务可以实现可重复性、在哪些情境下最为关键，以及构建者在过程中需要检查哪些内容。该内部工作的成功让团队有信心将相同的能力提供给客户和合作伙伴。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ece7a977822f5353",
      "translationZh": "对于任何产品部署自定义代理的速度超过工程师手工构建速度的团队来说，Cresta 的方法是一个有价值的参考点：使用代理或元代理时，初始构建完成后，后续工作往往是最困难的部分。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6ff8dc1d29a71ee",
      "translationZh": "了解 Conductor 如何将业务背景转化为更佳的代理设计、实施以及持续改进。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "217e1077b6f7659e",
      "translationZh": "来自Cresta团队的最佳实践：对你的产品进行自测",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "98db0c66c58b4201",
      "translationZh": "Conductor 最初作为内部工具运行，只有当其输出达到具备深度 AI 专业知识的工程师所能构建的水平时，才转变为产品。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "980d353b06bdc9b1",
      "translationZh": "专注于你的独特优势",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07a3ba0843c9dc8e",
      "translationZh": "Cresta 在他们能够提供的专有专业知识（他们的对话数据和对客户体验的理解）与可以从 Agent SDK 中直接获取的通用功能之间划清了明确界限，并且拒绝在错误的方向上进行任何构建。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "626c8c5d9fd22243",
      "translationZh": "你的代理的哪些部分需要是确定性的",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "580f22f0b964989a",
      "translationZh": "强化那些绝不能出错的企业关键工作流，并让其余部分保持灵活，否则你将无法获得想要的交互式代理体验。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2afd78d69b1bc6a7",
      "translationZh": "进入生产阶段是容易的部分",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
